00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:57.404 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais aussi avec l'équipement

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:58.939 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et ce qu'on leur donne

00:03:56.236 --> 00:04:00.473 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour aller au front.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:04:02.008 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il y a des témoignages

00:03:59.272 --> 00:04:03.543 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui nous arrivent

00:04:00.807 --> 00:04:05.078 size:53% position:73% line:53%
