00:04:03.877 --> 00:04:08.114 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la caméra ouvertement :

00:04:05.412 --> 00:04:09.649 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"On manque de bouffe,

00:04:06.947 --> 00:04:11.217 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on manque d'équipement,

00:04:08.448 --> 00:04:12.519 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on a aucun ordre, on a eu deux

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:14.054 size:53% position:73% line:53%
