00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:32.138 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais est-ce que c'est vrai?

00:04:28.802 --> 00:04:33.540 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le temps nous le dira.

00:04:31.071 --> 00:04:34.975 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et rapidement en terminant,

00:04:32.472 --> 00:04:36.409 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je disais est-ce que

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:37.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
