00:05:38.038 --> 00:05:41.007 size:53% position:73% line:53%
assez faible pour le moment.

00:05:39.139 --> 00:05:42.442 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On va espérer que ça reste

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.442 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme ça. Tamara Altéresco,

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:42.442 size:53% position:73% line:53%
merci beaucoup. Au revoir.

